---
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/site-layout.astro";
import { site } from "../site";
---
<SiteLayout title="Marbles — Foundry" description="Build local automations in TypeScript with Marbles.">
  <article class="wrap product-page">
    <header>
      <p class="section-label">Marbles</p>
      <h1>Make work you can inspect and change.</h1>
      <p class="product-page-intro">Write automations in TypeScript. Connect steps into workflows, give agents a place to work, and keep decisions with the people responsible for them.</p>
      <a class="button" href={`${site.docs}marbles/get-started/quickstart/`}>Start with Marbles</a>
    </header>
    <section>
      <h2>Start with a task</h2>
      <div>
        <p>A task records work to be done. An observer can react when a task changes, check its current state, and record an outcome. Begin with a small intake marker, then decide what action belongs next.</p>
        <a class="text-link" href={`${site.docs}marbles/get-started/task-loop/`}>Build the task loop →</a>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h2>Compose the work</h2>
      <div>
        <p>Steps perform work; workflows arrange steps. Agents can contribute judgment, while commands and checks provide evidence. Inspect runs and ask a person for a decision when the work needs one.</p>
        <a class="text-link" href={`${site.docs}marbles/foundation/definitions-and-instances/`}>Explore the foundations →</a>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h2>Grow into a factory floor</h2>
      <div>
        <p>Development, maintenance, and improvement can each have their own workflows. The Software Factory guide connects those loops with shared records and human ownership.</p>
        <a class="text-link" href={`${site.docs}marbles/use-cases/software-factory/`}>Visit the factory floor →</a>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h2>Run it where you need it</h2>
      <div>
        <p>Run a definition from the CLI, embed an engine in a Bun program, or dispatch work from an MCP client. The library guides show the same step through each path.</p>
        <a class="text-link" href={`${site.docs}marbles/library/`}>Read the library guides →</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </article>
</SiteLayout>
